<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Stable Danish crown in coming year - poll.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Stable Danish crown in coming year - poll.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Danish crown will fall slightly but remain basically stable between 3.8510-3.8655 per mark in the next 12 months, according to a Reuter survey issued on Friday.</p>
<p>Fourteen Danish and foreign banks and brokerage firms were asked in recent days to predict where exchange rates would be three, six and 12 months from now. They came up with the following average forecasts:</p>
<p>			    3-mo	6-mo	12-mo</p>
<p> Crowns per mark     3.8510    3.8570    3.8655</p>
<p>The Danish crown traded at 3.8312 per mark at 0730 GMT on Friday October 11.</p>
<p>Crowns per mark:</p>
<p>					  3-mths   6-mths   12-mths</p>
<p> Den Danske Bank		     3.86     -	3.86</p>
<p> Unibank				 3.87    3.87    3.85</p>
